        <activityName xml:lang="en">Palladium, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Palladium, at regional storage
The consumer mix is an assembly of the primary palladium transported from ZA and RUS for consumption in Europe and secondary palladium recovered and consumed in RER according the global market share in 2002.;
UUID: fdb5ae4c-a3d6-35f7-b7e6-0156433958d3
Primary PGM transported from ZA and RU for consumption in Europe and secondary PGM recovered and consumed in RER.
Location: Global supply data for Europe used, no import statistic available. Supply per region is assumed to correspond to the import to Europe
Technology: European consumer mix
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 54.9 t / a
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fdb5ae4c-a3d6-35f7-b7e6-0156433958d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
